<title>NEW ZEALAND: Geary retires as chairman of TVNZ, Tourism Board.</title>
<headline>Geary retires as chairman of TVNZ, Tourism Board.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norman Geary said on Tuesday he was retiring as chairman of Television New Zealand and the New Zealand Tourism Board.</p>
<p>He had advised the government mid-year he would not be seeking reappointment to either post.</p>
<p>Geary said that at the government's request, he had agreed to remain as TVNZ chairman until the end of February 1997 to allow for the new government to find a successor.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
